{"name": "Time To Wake Up", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/480e51fc4a4f8d4cff17deee61949d04.avif?t=1787553300\" width=\"1535\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/417dcd3c4a7f9d5d23bdb579be14cf9f.poster.avif?t=1787553300\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/417dcd3c4a7f9d5d23bdb579be14cf9f.webm?t=1787553300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/417dcd3c4a7f9d5d23bdb579be14cf9f.mp4?t=1787553300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time To Wake Up</strong> is an atmospheric psychological thriller. One night, you find yourself stuck in a dream. No worries, though. You are not alone. You hear a voice, that is fond of your eyes. Willing to help you out, you both set out on a trip down memory lane. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/c1d7068451ab769e70506a841d0bbbd9.avif?t=1787553300\" width=\"1535\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/67e73bd21b7c9d9415eb8bd4b939901e.poster.avif?t=1787553300\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/67e73bd21b7c9d9415eb8bd4b939901e.webm?t=1787553300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/67e73bd21b7c9d9415eb8bd4b939901e.mp4?t=1787553300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your eyes are the key out of this maze of memories. Blink and change your surroundings, switch and reset all moving elements, flood whole rooms, or turn them around. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/6da386716e9c9ca1f85ac6151cdcdff6.avif?t=1787553300\" width=\"1535\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/d061bc7c259ce63927ed45c85bf29587.poster.avif?t=1787553300\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/d061bc7c259ce63927ed45c85bf29587.webm?t=1787553300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/extras/d061bc7c259ce63927ed45c85bf29587.mp4?t=1787553300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time To Wake Up</strong> takes you through surreal school environments. Imagine dim-lit libraries, perplexing playgrounds, toilets offering twists and turns, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time To Wake Up features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>English, Chinese (traditional and simplified), Japanese, Korean, and Dutch language support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WARNING:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The save file of the demo and the save file of the full game are NOT compatible. All progress in the demo will not be transferred to the full version of the game.</strong></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "You're stuck in a dream. Blink and change your surroundings to escape the shadows of your past.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2509870/a4a4f3b2e7c593ac4f5d35730ba6f5ba7fe924fd/header.jpg?t=1787553300", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Story Rich", "Atmospheric", "Mystery", "Adventure", "Exploration", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Eye Blink Twice", "publishers": "Eye Blink Twice", "release_date": "October 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2509870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/UoVsrsmzK1A", "first_seen": 1774821600.0, "review_rank": 925}